sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Collector/Contributor
  participant API as Contribution API
  participant P as Payment Service
  participant F as Finance Service
  participant D as Document Service
  participant N as Notification Service
  C->>API: Record or initiate payment (idempotency key)
  API->>P: Verify provider/manual collection
  P-->>API: Verified payment event
  API->>API: Update bill + create contribution
  API->>F: Post ledger command/event
  API->>D: Allocate and generate receipt
  D-->>N: Receipt ready
  N-->>C: Deliver receipt
